  "details": "<p>The <em>tribus Palatina </em>was one of the four, large, urban tribes of Rome (<em>Palatina</em>,\u00a0<em>Collina</em>, <em>Esquilina</em>, <em>Suburana</em>), which corresponded to the four urban regions that Servius Tullius created.</p>",
